title: Two compact views with unsaved edits that show the same node refuse each other's saves, so edit and save one view at a time and close it after.
pid: 6ff68950-5fca-4a46-91ff-61de0afc6366
body: |2-
  'save' without '--yes' leaves the view edited, and the daemon names
  every edited view in each later save. Run over 25 notes at once, 14
  saves were refused ("conflicts with unsaved dependencies in
  content-view:ID"), since one note's view drew another as its child.
  'close SIDECAR' on each, then view, edit, save and close one at a time,
  saved all 14.
